Changes and build scripts (in wasm/ of the package, and in the repository under core/utils-copyleft/wasm/)
  wasm/nano/build.sh
    the build; patches src/nano.c so TERM=xterm.js (or unset) falls back to xterm-256color and a SHELL that is not a path falls back to /bin/sh, and src/files.c and src/text.c so an executed command, the formatter and the linter are started with posix_spawn where nano forks, and the text a command filters is sent from a thread where a forked process sent it; builds ncurses with built-in terminfo entries

The changes were made in 2026; the repository history dates each one.

Toolchain: WALI's musl and the LLVM runtimes (musl 243ec00c3ffb910375db487d7eb24ea76d1e2c9f, LLVM 22.1.8), with the patches in utils/wali/patches;
utils/wali-version in the repository pins them, and utils/wali/build-sysroot.sh builds them.

Where to get it
  - /sources/nano-9.2.tar.xz on the site that served this program, and the other archives listed above in the same place
  - the sources/ and wasm/ directories of the npm package @ecmaos/coreutils-copyleft, in the version that holds this file
  - https://github.com/ecmaos/ecmaos (core/utils-copyleft), at the tag of the release that holds this file
